    {
      "name": "Administrative Augmentations",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor04It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Prefect has Scribe-Tines and Interface Port augmetics.  Air of Authority: The first time the Prefect meets a group, they can make a Challenging (+0) Presence or Rapport test. On a success, they gain +1 influence with that group until the end of the mission.  Bureaucratic Boldness: The Administratum Prefect has a Resolve of 3 whenever dealing with paperwork, tithes, or any other bureaucratic conversation.  Data Delver: The Administratum Prefect has Advantage on Tests made to find or retrieve information from a document or archive (whether analog or digital).  Frozen Assets: The Administratum Prefect may make an Opposed Challenging (+0) Lore (Adeptus Terra) test versus the influence of a target (where the influence is the amount of SL they gained) to reduce the target's Influence with a faction by 1 per SL. These assets are not lost, and the target may recover influence If the Prefect (or another official) gives the order to lift the freeze. Otherwise, the target recovers Influence lost this way automatically, at a rate of 1 per month (as he slowly regains access to his assets)</p>"
        },
